cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BECA — Bounded Evolutionary Commit Architecture"
message: "If you discuss or build on BECA, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "iking-i"
version: "0.1"
date-released: 2026-09-30
repository-code: "https://github.com/iking-i/beca-architecture"
url: "https://github.com/iking-i/beca-architecture"
abstract: >-
  BECA is a conceptual architecture for multi-agent knowledge systems in which
  agents share a common initial worldview, evolve in different local regions of
  the same world, communicate during that evolution, and expose stabilized
  source conclusions to a higher-level integration process.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - knowledge integration
  - conceptual architecture
  - distributed intelligence
  - agent communication
  - knowledge provenance
license: CC-BY-4.0
